luci-theme-mission21-argon - "Mission Control on Argon (21.02 port)"

Layout, templates, menu script, icon font and jQuery copy from luci-theme-argon 2.3.1
by jerrykuku, https://github.com/jerrykuku/luci-theme-argon (Apache-2.0).
Colours and content styling from luci-theme-mission by vistrocity,
https://github.com/vistrocity/openwrt-luci-themes (Apache-2.0), itself a fork of
luci-theme-bootstrap (OpenWrt LuCI project, Apache-2.0).

Port changes (2026, Dror Dvash): Argon's online wallpapers, /etc/config/argon
settings, background photos, TypoGraphica font and legacy font formats removed;
theme colours mapped onto Argon; phone fix for "-- custom --" dropdown entries.
